# Directories renv must not read when it works out which R packages this
# project needs. Same pattern syntax as .gitignore.
#
# Everything listed here is a hand-written script that nothing runs any more:
# no check executes it, no Python script launches it, and it is kept only so
# the older work stays readable. Between them they load egg, directlabels and
# rlist, which are not installed on this machine, and renv cannot record a
# version for a package it cannot find. Listing them here keeps renv.lock
# about the code that actually draws the charts.
#
# OlderFiles/planarsviz_superseded/ is deliberately NOT listed. The porting
# checks run those scripts to prove the planarsviz package draws what they
# drew, so their packages -- pacman, here, tidyverse, ggsci -- are as
# load-bearing as the package's own, and belong in the lockfile.

OlderFiles/ConstituencyConvergenceDBScripts/
OlderFiles/MakeDomains/
OlderFiles/scripts/
scripts/domainSignificance.r
